{
  "version": 1,
  "_note": "买卖力量:盘口 20 档买卖金额占比 + 价差(基点)+ 最近 60 笔里主动买入的金额占比与覆盖的分钟数。",
  "i18n": {
    "zh-CN": {
      "noBook": "取不到盘口数据，部分地区暂不提供"
    },
    "en-US": {
      "noBook": "Order book unavailable — not offered in some regions"
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kr",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${pair},btcusd)]"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 入参先落地:方法参数里看不见 flow 入参(§9.5 #3)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k",
        "value": "$[if::(contains::(${kr},-),toUpperCase::(${kr}),connect::(toUpperCase::(if::(endsWith::(${kr},usdt),subString::(${kr},0,calc::(length::(${kr})-4)),if::(endsWith::(${kr},usdc),subString::(${kr},0,calc::(length::(${kr})-4)),if::(endsWith::(${kr},usd),subString::(${kr},0,calc::(length::(${kr})-3)),${kr})))),-,if::(endsWith::(${kr},usdc),USDC,USDT)))]"
      },
      "_note": "币对归一:老实例是 Bitstamp 形状 `btcusd`,新实例是 OKX instId `BTC-USDT`,两种都认。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sym",
        "value": "$[index::(split::(${k},-),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "concurrent",
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "request",
          "id": "b",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.okx.com/api/v5/market/books?instId=${k}&sz=20",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "request",
          "id": "t",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.okx.com/api/v5/market/trades?instId=${k}&limit=60",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a1",
        "value": "$[index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b1",
        "value": "$[index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${a1}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "${@i18n.noBook}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "盘口 / 逐笔是交易所专属数据,没有 Coinbase 那种备用源(crypto_fallback 只兜现货价与 K 线);OKX 在部分地区(如美国)不可用时这里恒失败 —— 失败文案直说(2026-10-08)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bL",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "买方段 / 主数字的颜色旗标(恒为买方 = 涨色);取数失败时不存在 → 渲染层落灰"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bR",
        "value": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bidN",
        "value": "$[calc::(findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),0),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),0),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),1),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),1),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),2),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),2),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),3),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),3),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),4),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),4),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),5),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),5),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),6),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),6),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),7),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),7),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),8),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),8),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),9),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),9),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),10),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),10),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),11),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),11),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),12),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),12),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),13),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),13),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),14),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),14),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),15),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),15),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),16),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),16),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),17),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),17),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),18),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),18),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),19),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),bids),19),1),0))]"
      },
      "_note": "20 档逐档 价 × 量 求和(金额口径,不是张数 —— 低价档一大堆张数会虚高)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "askN",
        "value": "$[calc::(findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),0),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),0),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),1),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),1),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),2),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),2),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),3),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),3),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),4),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),4),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),5),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),5),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),6),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),6),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),7),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),7),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),8),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),8),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),9),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),9),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),10),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),10),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),11),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),11),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),12),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),12),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),13),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),13),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),14),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),14),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),15),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),15),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),16),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),16),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),17),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),17),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),18),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),18),1),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),19),0),0)*findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(get::(index::(${b.data},0),asks),19),1),0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bidR",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${bidN}/(${bidN}+${askN})*100),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bidUp",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${bidR},50),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sx",
        "value": "$[max::(8,min::(126,calc::(${bidR}*1.34)))]"
      },
      "_note": "分界点(条宽 134 内的像素)。两段各在分界前后收 2pt、中间露 4pt 卡底当缝 —— 不再拿卡底色竖线去盖:卡底是渐变,盖上去的颜色对不上;圆头也会伸进对方 3pt 互相压。夹在 [8,126] 让极端盘面下少的一侧仍剩一个圆点。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bxL",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${sx}-5),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "bxR",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${sx}+5),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "spr",
        "value": "$[calc::(${a1}-${b1})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sprS",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${spr}/((${a1}+${b1})/2)*10000),0.00)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tvB",
        "value": "$[calc::(if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},0),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},0),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},0),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},1),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},1),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},1),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},2),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},2),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},2),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},3),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},3),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},3),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},4),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},4),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},4),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},5),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},5),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},5),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},6),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},6),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},6),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},7),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},7),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},7),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},8),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},8),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},8),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},9),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},9),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},9),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},10),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},10),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},10),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},11),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},11),px),0)*findNotEmpty::(get::(index::(${t.data},11),sz),0)),0)+if::(eq::(get::(index::(${t.data},12),side),buy),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(index: